<div class="best-features about-features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Our Background</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="right-image">
          <img src="~/cassets/images/feature-image.jpg" alt="">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="left-content">
          <h4>Who we are &amp; What we do?</h4>
          <p>FPTBook is a leading e-commerce website in Vietnam, specializing in the sale of books. With a wide
            selection of over 10 million books from diverse genres, FPTBook is a one-stop shop for all your book needs.
            Whether you're looking for the latest bestseller, a classic novel, or a specialized textbook, FPTBook has
            you covered. At FPTBook, we understand that books are more than just words on a page. They're gateways to
            new worlds, vehicles of knowledge, and sources of inspiration. That's why we're committed to providing our
            customers with the best possible book-shopping experience. Whether you're a student, a teacher, a bookworm,
            or just someone who enjoys reading, FPTBook is the perfect place to buy books online. With our wide
            selection of books, competitive prices, fast and reliable shipping, secure payment options, and excellent
            customer service, FPTBook is the best place to shop for books in Vietnam.</p>
          <ul class="social-icons">
            <li><a href="#"><i class="fa fa-facebook"></i></a></li>
            <li><a href="#"><i class="fa fa-twitter"></i></a></li>
            <li><a href="#"><i class="fa fa-linkedin"></i></a></li>
            <li><a href="#"><i class="fa fa-behance"></i></a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


